              <p class="flex items-baseline gap-1"><span class="text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight tabular-nums">$10</span><span class="text-neutral-faded">per month</span></p>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-faded">Basic features for up to 10 people, with everything you need.</p>
              <Button href="#" fullWidth>Get started</Button>
              <Button href="#" variant="outline" color="neutral" fullWidth>Chat to sales</Button>
            </div>
          </th>
